xenrSJmUSL9FZmwH3t-mRQ&oe=6AA94FAC"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-34-26.mkv_snapshot_01.18.466_1440.png", "id": "3465087683770757", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974780_3465087687104090_5745773893023703044_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nS_GEwVKyNUQ7kNvwFXbXuI&_nc_oc=AdqKfTpiiXbuPegCczWwC2O4G1fKnOiWvTeHZWspi3E5agx9KOod5ovBNoWJCYw9d88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIbKf3OvuOflbFwIkbVQoz7yVV19eKXetmQkTDw2nDwjw&oe=6AA958E0"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-01-54.mkv_snapshot_00.25.826_1440.png", "id": "495260649347486", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974891_495260652680819_1612014108408918328_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UNJUn2Km3wQ7kNvwEKLJ3u&_nc_oc=AdpGXhzb7T9RE3VCeJyjqG-LSGV48A4KO_6cFpTR51QeCbbWEsriET5uBEmRRYICAXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIkbqlTGNPFYH41Ze83mfBukJ6MnbBbubv4CtuNzwoyKw&oe=6AA947C3"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-57-00.mkv_snapshot_01.20.540_1440.png", "id": "910860627004003", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974801_910860630337336_8867062962642311624_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7MfhDLPkFuEQ7kNvwGSibyT&_nc_oc=Adqhno06Jt3aaySuXRy7slUWnKalW_uN1mULazPMod1AgFS4Tz4gpyZ6vwjpKnNVyQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJbSP6K91jDrodD9MRAp69953HNSLinbFGQhs53qEEnEg&oe=6AA9393F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Unification_release-trailer_thumbnail_quest.png", "id": "222585180139802", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003238_222585183473135_4209265122119070746_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YkOPubop6B4Q7kNvwG9mVH-&_nc_oc=AdpsLy8_X8tzCltyjtDbnJIsZzx7JhnPmZVr-7mXK2s5mobBwXzXCT4TyhAoMvvuF60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLnyh5_Ob9YFCozMFsiCZSbYVPh4J6xXql3cNEAoqRCCw&oe=6AA96525"}, "display_name": "Unification", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fluid and powerful physics-based movement: Feel momentum and the wind rushing past while leaping into chasms, vaulting over ledges, weaving around traps, and shifting gravity at will.\n- Kinetic tools propelling you forward: Swing above traps with a grappling hook, or glide past with a parachute. Go in guns blazing with a shotgun, or slice with a katana. Forge a new path with a jackhammer, or warp through with a teleporter.\n- Procedural destructible biomes filled with traps and enemies: Navigate through voxel cave obstacle courses with branching paths that test your reactions, knowledge, and control. Feel free to explore the depths and get lost. The handheld mini-map and conveniently placed teleporters make it easy to quickly get back on track.\n- Dreamlike upgrades: Push the limits of physics and imagination during the journey to the core with fundamental changes to the game mechanics\n- Carefully crafted controls and haptics: Each action is positioned on the controllers to allow effortless simultaneous usage of all movement and tool capabilities, inducing a flow state of control.", "short_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path."}]}, "developer_name": "Troy Spencer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/troyspencer/7c0c9a0f5b23daf767866b9416a145fd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrushPoint Games"